## Repo rules (Wordle - vanilla static)
- Tech stack: Vanilla HTML/CSS/JS (no build step, no dependencies)
- Data: Static word lists bundled in `js/words.js`
- Hosting target: Netlify (static)
- Never try to start the app itself (I have it running in a separate terminal)
- Before making changes, review Lessons section of `Docs/Context/briefing.md` for known pitfalls in this codebase
## Project Context
- Current product spec: `Docs/Context/briefing.md`
- Current feature map: `Docs/Context/feature_map.md`
- Current architecture: `Docs/Context/architecture.md`
- Before implementing features, verify alignment with the active product spec.
